  "title": "Jose Carmona",
  "summary": "Jose “Pepe” Carmona joined ADC Therapeutics as Chief Financial Officer in December 2022 bringing over 20 years of financial experience in the biotechnology and pharmaceutical industries. Prior to ADC Therapeutics, Mr. Carmona was the CFO at Rubius Therapeutics, a biopharmaceutical company engineering red blood cells to create a new class of cellular medicines for cancer […]",
